@startuml
title RF32 — Loja de itens customizáveis (Scores Points) · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "Filtros" as Filtros
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
database "S3/MinIO" as S3
Manager -> Frontend: abre a loja e filtra capacetes
Frontend -> API: GET /store/catalog?category=HELMET&cursor=
API -> Filtros: rate limit store 20/min · sessão ativa
API -> UseCase: StoreCatalogService.list(filtro, userId)
UseCase -> MySQL: StoreItem PUBLISHED + posse do usuário
MySQL --> UseCase: página + possuídos
API --> Frontend: 200 (ETag)
Frontend -> S3: thumbnails (CDN)
Manager -> Frontend: Comprar → Confirmar
Frontend -> API: POST /store/purchases {productCode} Idempotency-Key
API -> UseCase: PurchaseService.purchase(cmd, userId, key)
UseCase -> MySQL: SELECT purchase WHERE idempotency_key = key
alt chave repetida
  API --> Frontend: 200 Idempotent-Replayed
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: produto + promoção + posse + compatibilidade
  alt indisponível / incompatível / já possuído
    API --> Frontend: 409 / 422
  else senão
    UseCase -> MySQL: BEGIN · SELECT wallet (USER ou SAVE) FOR UPDATE
    alt saldo insuficiente
      UseCase -> MySQL: ROLLBACK
      API --> Frontend: 422 INSUFFICIENT_POINTS
    else senão
      UseCase -> MySQL: PointsTransaction PURCHASE (balanceAfter) · Purchase · direito · inventário
      UseCase -> AuditService: record(STORE_PURCHASE, product, preço, correlationId)
      UseCase -> MySQL: COMMIT
      UseCase -> Redis: espelho do saldo
      UseCase -> EventBus: PurchaseCompleted
      API --> Frontend: 201 {purchase, wallet}
    end
  end
end
Admin -> Frontend: reembolsar compra
Frontend -> API: POST /admin/store/purchases/{id}/refund
API -> UseCase: PurchaseService.refund
UseCase -> MySQL: TX: PointsTransaction REFUND · direito revogado · unequip
UseCase -> AuditService: record(STORE_REFUND)
API --> Frontend: 200
@enduml
